OL,3,AInternational students, 'visa hoppers'
OL,4,Aand backpackers targeted in Australia
OL,5,Amigration crackdown
OL,6,
OL,7,FInternational students, so-called "visa
OL,8,Fhoppers" and backpackers will be
OL,9,Ftargeted under stricter rules announced
OL,10,Fby Australia on Thursday in a bid to
OL,11,Fcurb immigration.
OL,13,FForeign students will no longer be able
OL,14,Fto bring their families with them and
OL,15,Fthose who want to extend their stay
OL,16,Fmust choose a higher qualification.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
