OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AInternational students, 'visa hoppers'
OL,4,Aand backpackers targeted in Australia
OL,5,Amigration crackdown
OL,6,
OL,7,FRules will also be stricter for working
OL,8,Fholiday visas - commonly used by
OL,9,Fbackpackers and a crucial labour source
OL,10,Ffor the agricultural sector - with a
OL,11,Fballot system although these changes
OL,12,Fwill not affect the UK.
OL,14,FThe new rules were revealed by Home
OL,15,FAffairs Minister Tony Burke who said
OL,16,Fthat while immigration was a "strength"
OL,17,Fof Australia, there needed to be a
OL,18,F"high level of control".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
